\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.2}{\ignorespaces What one strand holds after two derivative steps, for the winning strand of Figure~\ref {fig:frontier}. The bit-coded strand accumulates into a flat buffer; the tree-building strand accumulates a chain of heap-allocated closures, one link per step, each holding the next. Both are consumed exactly once, on the winning strand, at the end of the input.}}{60}{figure.caption.28}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:strand-state}{{6.2}{60}{What one strand holds after two derivative steps, for the winning strand of Figure~\ref {fig:frontier}. The bit-coded strand accumulates into a flat buffer; the tree-building strand accumulates a chain of heap-allocated closures, one link per step, each holding the next. Both are consumed exactly once, on the winning strand, at the end of the input}{figure.caption.28}{}}
